{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1322,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b4b596b0275f9ab14009b62",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有时睡不着的时候会去神社转转。\n夜晚的神社真的非常幽静呢…\n感觉自己从内到外都焕然一新了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b9eabf43be771305457e665c4e3d5a61cdade1bef59f96ca105eccf496b1f0a8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "90015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:64532d8a7b034d87b1a786e2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "花和团子，你更喜欢团子吗？\n但要是说我就是“花”的话…\n…这里可是笑点啊。真是的…",
      "source_fingerprint": "8fe7f0ea85cb9b53841147ebbde5b4d718949217284e8285bb9c48cd70a5e4d5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "90016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:06bde6b205db380d5261be02",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊…要不要再买把扇子呢。\n就买把紫色的吧，和比赛很搭啊。\n和我的衣服也很配吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5806e7bc304a36870eb268fb3f9f1d5ab3d909a36bf3e12df2a37cd59ec63242",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "90017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f417cb239386db43eccc11c3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "夏天和秋天的祭典气氛截然呢。\n虽然不太喜欢去人多的地方，\n但是秋天天气比较凉爽，应该还能接受吧…",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e5fa46a6bdd48390d83fee2f4dddced15517b591baf42da2057c7f7191e6eaa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "90018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:746cd90a91998bd6f09cd493",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…嘿嘿。啊抱歉，想起了有趣的事。\n阿雪用雪堆了一致白兔子出来，\n那双又白又圆的眼睛很可爱呢…",
      "source_fingerprint": "bdcfb275df5858a90ae2d0c5d3b60e5902d1610b214bdd52b267faa4e957ae57",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "90019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4d4a0f1f550e72e8e229f6ef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐",
      "source_fingerprint": "9392c70765a5a96081978bc15cd29abd7d78628fdd8840f21389130a9a70469b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3334214071748b8e93aa9244",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐",
      "source_fingerprint": "9392c70765a5a96081978bc15cd29abd7d78628fdd8840f21389130a9a70469b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "90021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9d190f65e88e26cbf0cac23c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……啊，抱歉，暂停一会。\n经纪人打了电话过来，我接一下。\n稍等我一会哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "74b32540252cfbdbd89e9f6991972a3043c1a4d71ec9f2e67890039260ca900e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e412f3000ce01b7e1e4d5256",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的发型？…嘛，我还挺喜欢的哦。\n从我很小的时候开始，\n爸爸就一直在给我做这种发型。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1576100ff5aa709890dbff7d72751210657631ff25d4131cb56685c71bca701e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2b07dd23f6c21e0f62b3f220",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "昨天雪之美人来请教我服装搭配呢。\n明明她穿什么衣服都很合适，\n所以穿她喜欢的衣服就好了呀。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3d865e1e391eb7e54294bdee930b2867f7ee84ea1b2fb1960bedafb06bb93605",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:07d12cbcd1a67bef321f8eba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "刚才开始手机就叫个不停，烦死了。\n反正多半是佐敦那家伙一直在喊我\n一块去吃饭吧…",
      "source_fingerprint": "63bd419a667ff8ea768c602220e6e79e6d7fd4ac72973fa57416860eb907bdf3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a4de27b5a9ac7a47441c8fb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "俗话说树大招风，不管别人说什么\n我都应该保持一颗平常心…\n但我也没法对那些留言一笑而过啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5efd8a46f7dc7b46d6e5372b30de85827640a240a169583ad1340acf7d99c21f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:491e6acda02dd8bac8a0f552",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "尺寸感OK，合身感OK。\n没事的，要上了哦。\n能够站在舞台上的，舍我其谁！",
      "source_fingerprint": "409650ea95f9c28e88bf4eb7e86880232906717fc5bc6a8b2cc1661dd82bc9d4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a1cfcfe80a366c9adf88563f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "全力奔跑、全力舞蹈，全力闪耀。\n然后，向所有人宣告——\n“我”就在这里！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0c827cc4838dcef485a9970d38f260136c0a3c92a80e6fad12322d776e5005e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0bc5a38664b54268444229fb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "穿上这身衣服的话，就会觉得那个\n真正的“我”在推着我前进呢。\n我也得朝着“我”努力才行呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "db42df823a8ad2d38f97a038f36200505ba29bf611c6ee9a02d22f150163c278",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a7edc4341934ee07e6a7f36e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "从头看到脚也没问题哦。\n比谁都更帅气、比谁都更强大、\n比谁都更耀眼…这自信我还是有的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b18580051ac349712a0bbde49b78e5cf00d24436947c04e63cd14e4459bb93f2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7dbd496efd929404ed6caf65",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "已经到早上了？不可能吧…\n让我再睡一会…这也不可能啊。\n呼哇～啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a30f9facdb1176330e1cb6cf6eaab2f0590ea90d0b4c1f8400143b0a30b786c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:60797a6a59f423fca0bd73ad",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要不现在就去训练吧？\n要是不去运动一下的话，\n满脑子都是乱七八糟的事情…",
      "source_fingerprint": "3e8823d7a0770daabc3c08973d687e957d37af27b5446f9d09ced294470bab12",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b444cc48c5be3ed3a55f6a62",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哇…彻底搞砸了啊…\n忘记提前说我会晚归了，\n会被青竹前辈骂的吧…",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c2a5da7164f8d4c7a60ce31778d40479e150dfa41ceb11b7ea6785081b08d6e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:548a33fdef62f822f048f116",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "气候回暖真是帮大忙啦～\n现在拍外景的时候也不会觉得冷啦！\n真是老天爷开眼呀～",
      "source_fingerprint": "731a53518f067745b84471ef1dfe4592ef756858a934af00240dcae0f3100be9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2e335e8a073511be91500e37",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好热…热到脑子都不想动了…\n是因为平时冷饮喝多了吗…\n现在喝白开水也完全不解渴…",
      "source_fingerprint": "30a1ccfa63d65577863f21ae71303e689bfc1e56ce2e20dd6217ba6d6976f6c1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e27d0f74deea5b111267d0f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "『秋天正是丰收之际——』…\n等下，这话你是看着我的头发说的？\n因为很漂亮？…那真是多谢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e99af98b4ffcdd4e306c9e91bcf2637010836300d8c652f3b8a6ff61e289e0e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:76b73127397d79c60330038f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…最近气候挺干燥的吧？\n晚上用点安瓿美容液，\n护理一下皮肤吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "116ac1c557347ef24f6a2fcc196fc26e250f6e2213f86976c7cf7e48c12a3202",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c98c0b29d45774e064158c3a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这次的妆容是以“艳”为主。\n口红和眼影用的是红色系，\n底妆也用了粉底液来表现光面妆感呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8e62e396cb8885e68f72e53b329fcd1b24eaa013badf7442e47b08b448c23974",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "91016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3c6e0dca9de13918efca303d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "初见『骏大祭』的时候大受震撼呢。\n当时实在太过震撼就跑掉了，之后还违反门禁而被骂了，令人怀念呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bbea93de389b9a5b0eb975e8c0fe5b7740670ec73dcd1f30369a74483e9c076b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "91017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8c935386a4f6044b100aace1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "说到会长…啊，没什么。\n…她好像偶尔会说些冷笑话？\n应该是我的错觉吧，应该。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0566090299120d73da3d5e2cf2e43869ac190e289264e37be5c8a62cda9326cc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "91018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c8f1b7a1c17e66521918f7c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "卡莲上传的『骏大祭』的照片，\n风景什么的拍得都很好。\n那孩子拍照的天赋可真不是盖的啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4a61411ba066d1adec8866f05801cf0b7e40187a9479b13ddd482bc35be99b12",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "91019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2bd11313e7895aad21d84809",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "听我说，佐敦又给我拍了一堆照片。\n只要碰见她就会被她拍照这种事情\n我可受够了。你也想想办法啦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f0c5abdee77cf44414a5ce16d5a73a0bf7324faf8eab020d7ba5212f33ea17c9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "91020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:30f2cf89445fd5f39ce66058",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "想吃日式料理。我还挺喜欢的哦？\n从早餐开始就营养丰盛，\n能吃到烤鱼之类的东西。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b45831c1c7104aee6845084c1186cd4727d3d335bdbbd0c0725ea72018ca7a1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "91021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:21a9f26d7125e8864545d61d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "对了，拍张照片发Umasta吧。\n明明是经纪人在运营，她却一直嚷嚷\n要炒热度什么的…哈啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b8926017aa4b0b8b8a2da596dc89556ea0e0b230e8d26701664bb3a894d16f59",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cbaf2899f84fb7deffd18e23",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "把头发绑好以后心情就会变好，\n这种感觉你明白吗？不过相应的，\n每次拆开时都会觉得很可惜呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c4c24218da748ab385a0c1e9e49e006d371cd4f74ba135813998db3501f5598c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d89c5eb856fd66492ec0027",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "樱花飘零时的模样，能作为参考吗？\n…不，轻盈过头了。我的话，\n应该用上更有力的舞蹈动作吧…",
      "source_fingerprint": "fddd764c33d5c41b9f74cdc7e1428f8d582ea291968f859267f53208115ee30c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "91024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:22b58c6adbf8b52deb3d5164",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊～真是凉爽的风呀～…\n没想到这套和服的透气性这么好，\n根本没有看上去那么热，我推荐哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "071ebf07f2c70b0c64036e431701fbdbf9e9383000455974c4f1f79c54ce5062",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "91025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c50d4754fe7177ba08ce71d8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "因为秋天有很多GⅠ比赛，\n所以我也明白大家想要祈愿的心情。\n但是最后还是得靠自己…对吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "05f91c55eb3d205d12b473a3119828569aacadd4f4d9c54c417a230c16445efd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "91026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f5885fd8df967cc8e7310f62",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…“不觉得冷吗”？\n当然觉得冷啊。不过工作的时候也\n经常在冬天穿泳装什么的，习惯啦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "57e9b2420995f63778e8bf271a934e5c30df7f2c5aa41329cba3ee568549b610",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:73d396a9f2e21095e397cd61",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要穿上这套衣服，\n就会不自觉地挺起胸膛。\n毕竟其中可承载着许多人的愿望呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d3e99121f6909653db18d56d15b81542ebe4469f500f57e83f96252a668296f8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b09100e7e125b253c8f8a75c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真是的…虽说差不多也快习惯了，\n但换这身衣服真的很费时间呢。\n有时候差点都站着睡着了…",
      "source_fingerprint": "d6cd2879f4bc87c647e6985b54b9ef538a62c7a8ccec3372cfdf835324338cc0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "91029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e9cf1a4fafcbd87331c6f46a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天要从什么开始练起？\n说说看你的计划吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8a63b3533f16e247885deddc070330de0fc1b2893215567c9b8f96f04a4704c4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8902104129a7561cb6136801",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ガチでいくから……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a4a415b05a7300f13978a302a6e01fd93b4c5609cb6e508131a92ddc73e68951",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a0b8e2225de5560c0604cb19",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那，差不多就开始训练吧。\n心理准备早就做好啦，\n接下来练就完事了吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "def55f2b2e164302a13e57687450d46e4837f879437cef59ae700af3ea3bbc4b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:48c63f4ab6ffca0d5c234d32",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…啊，你已经来了啊。\n难道你一直在这儿等我吗？\n哈啊…你可真闲啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ee3675ae50f157e5de2eaa34456ee66358bda624f7fbc4a15ee77376608be65e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:850f35dfd97b4c738a67714f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "OK，到时间了呢。\n…怎么了，不准备训练吗？\n啊，还是说准备去参加比赛？",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd613cc55bda33ee402b188a7617e73bd6832fa494dd454563c0f6231856038e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4256e84cb3bba2a49ba92d49",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…不用那么担心地看着我啦。\n你不是知道的吗？\n我最喜欢奔跑时候的我了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dec44b73a7ea50d029d1daa8f9412743f97071d717edc8611d943123b9c87aa3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7356fef8c0f04f4ff90e2a97",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是为了我自己才奔跑的。\n不过呢，你要是说想看看我奔跑时的\n模样的话，我也会跑给你看啦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f4d8b2f6a7bd15a8957448cc6449fa9883b840d6e352b4a451e5ac0c080fab7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6448f402e93c77c39341f300",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你想看看我奔跑时的模样吧？\n那就站近些好好注视着我啦。\n我会展现出最为闪耀的跑姿的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "96aa407d2a1024f0a784ab83ada12d20e61e1ee4433b490b97cfa3d594a4aa2d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e7b3e94b313ee8d8159be76",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你也准备好了的话，\n就赶紧开始训练吧？\n我现在可是想跑得不得了了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e2855eaf2154fe52560aefa088e82ee923119f3faa6c58964944c55a4d5fc022",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:89ad0f0b3b77748237d91eb4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "身体如舞蹈一般随心所动…\n嗯，感觉不错。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f1d420ce1c857e087c8bbff30c4b1705111accca9e0243a5f331ecd0d5b6aad1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4a658103e809d74cb6ffe48b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "『一二・一』！\n这样喊过之后就气势十足了。\n好，快开始吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a80029e7017558fb38cd37b303315af3fa89b14814ee8ec640580e6ba2741ef7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0cb116ffb6d65c03e41fec11",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……好。\n已经“天人合一”…了吧？感觉不错。",
      "source_fingerprint": "084ebce8ecae425f0171364dd21f510531fa94939242fed1d83394baae25efbf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:67c9b6a94b33088612be7fb6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "想要进步的话，必须要练习才行。\n今天也按平时那样努力吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "786d9de80660dddc65b5812ecddd16e8ba11cf09fa1911193b4119c89490f77a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b003734c2218ab61244a9bd3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和风服装的拍摄工作也做过不少了，\n穿着跑步也完全没问题啦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "14547185e0788b138b1686a83a22a481f44bf1fa46e60505c316be921e7565fd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed8138eb56a0dab0560a08d4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "麻烦你注意下我的跑步姿势啦。\n要是穿这身衣服却举止不得体的话\n就太逊了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "257be66dc52c6efc6540340d1b6608817d99af54bdaf8cc9446c86f5218c3b42",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd330b15ffc8d057cc3380f2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "休息的时候，我来跳支舞吧。\n…哈哈，开玩笑的啦。\n不过你真想看的话也不是不行哦？",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ab4daaa61de1efa78f13fbb896ab9508aaf01050e251f5004f62b82738301b3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1352514e2708b80d9a2a00df",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "见识到真正的“我”了吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "89fd1633a960b5db3e88b5c54e523a94f9c9d0733e00681a69a86675492903e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2370640ad6224a58067cb2bb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "稍微更接近那时候的“我”了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "64903d56199e4a8ee67862af7fac647a5b3be99a117d313bb9fe291db588a99d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c0feac9f1b48cf6fb52cb6a0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "即便祭典已经落幕…\n也要陪在我身边哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0eb4a743112652cab176dc61e7056afb520e1b168c45c6f034ae300dc33743d1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "93004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd98249e9bd13378ff462cd6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这样绚丽多彩的回忆…永生难忘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d7f7b9542f8a1d63f8e632d7de3a9c1aec759036131d81da2fc8363d1d3cfc45",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "93005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:00602ae5e143711f411f0a1d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好，总觉得力量涌上来了呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "71d38f6502a502fed43d6097c9644bc34e2e5e00e426f27ee704a58068b74f20",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:463f822507efc4bb736f6164",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "变得更加…更加更加\n更加强大才行！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b170285259f3194566ec9813aafa0d4a46de8350a9426c966826056febf95588",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b81195f90d4d013147aed980",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是黄金城市。你好啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9ed472930b906887059cf305747bd79947166ee44db23230d2a59d3a6c4f8e77",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:58dabf3ab60784c2e04a5e0a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一定要成为那个我想成为的“我”！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0565d6d45093d46b8935a2e7137f1681072f360b42ffc4076917e300d7a207c7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a8ae0b4e7d14fb265c54c93f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怎么样？这就是我的经纪人哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5fc0a202f996b00f22843d38589f25503e1d90e3a8ccc976852bc0e8fd7a8e8b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:27d49c467044f369e66b7730",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "经纪人的感情…了解之后就燃起来了呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e46cd8b535ff9bcb810349a99b6ff2c38e026d77f48c86a7c480f6f3dddd8431",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2db82832af4b251f5e6cba84",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "终于染上“我”的颜色了吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5176e78cd2a1e1027cf8fdc1b5862b867ea2e062852efbcdb960c900ef9f9da6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "95007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2bb8d99c7f8056d4e97b92c0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "对我刮目相看了吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "155fbf0474c10da3578c448d19a60f76a7323f45701c4d81a2d539487fe4601d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "95008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4875bbc9881633798b3628e2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "既然要上的话，\n那就跳出最为漂亮的舞蹈吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d183355162ecc49dd2ec87bee6eb991779ed47d883967e7dbcd26476831716ed",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "95009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f5ad3ae127dd48fcc0992a90",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "黄金城市。\n让我起舞吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "051fb11963e9dd69033be1444533df8c3cbcdd52893dbe2afae5d93953c6f332",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "95010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:97b30d3655c816a2d2f2501e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "跟着班长我冲啊ー！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a45f98a110986a3792d4db2d3020b3849c876f306d29f12ff1ab2589dde1a9e8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:45dd288dbd70f1d525bf8c5a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我在此立誓！在您的指导之下\r\n我将成为全赛马娘的模范……\r\n成为最强的班长！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4dd58d198ecfb99d426a54ba8d158786242721f129213db63f5de7b85009573d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:de56b698f16c0484e1110058",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行ってまいります！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b647331903ccfd460dce0cefc0d2c4020e3a5a1ffca47177a5bbb2bfe3b41d06",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7549e735e80a468835902a80",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ただいま戻りました！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9f8b04b4edb572764b45e483a28cd1cf6e40442b258dd629e84cb2d8e5633947",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cdd83bc7fd650f1cff91c4ce",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员的指导是不会错的！\r\n因为……您是我的训练员嘛！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "04ca6e09375bc86cb696d66b0397b603456a42be5abb8a24d5a9f11acf4432cb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6c16d6f06d31822441825fc2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "手机已经完全充满电了！\r\n无论我什么时候在哪迷路，\r\n都能跟训练员联系上！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b0e6a44f9ced9dd5c695d170b859639e2e4130a9048ba0940b7e72b49651f9c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:305c18d7182c72a934b30e5c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我今年的抱负是爆、进！\r\n去年的一月就决定好了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bfa792d7df40e74b90728731d3696301395392a8a7fb89e8b22da15fe01e2db3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:25d48da6567c5a2bb1eaf671",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我做到一半的巧克力……爆炸了。\r\n一定是承受不住\r\n我炽热的感谢之情才会这样！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a0c4adc70a8446fd7a74f9c2d3231b4cad888d3c8befce492b96af84be08291f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:96346f9073070403ff216991",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我为已经是成人的训练员！\r\n准备了焦黑的苦味巧克力哦！\r\n哼哼──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "834fbe7f595c0b0dec9550de552bba5e18374d1d26376acdcc7936a66f2121e2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ae2ce786afc80c095ff135d4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……要快速、要快速、要快速！\r\n来，过来吧流星！\r\n我已经准备好我的愿望了！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4006e0c777553e8edc43e3f643ab8c2a7e9deaebd799ae235fbf5dd818933891",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f18fef63e6169c1f88cc4e92",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不给糖就捣蛋！\r\n奇怪？我听说念这段咒语\r\n就能免费拿到点心的来着……",
      "source_fingerprint": "463573b9e72281f6a3c13057811e34db8671e0b475c88ae58b0cfdb8fc4cba67",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d873513962146e44186676e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要尽情享受圣诞节的气氛哦！\r\n所有活动都率先执行\r\n才是班长该有的样子！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0019338a5fefe12eeac5f7f1cb1fa4cb39546241c8e5dce59d0cdbf7e8a53882",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:66a36b91c11ecb028818c5d9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员，您知道吗？\r\n圣诞老人的速度是非常快的喔。\r\n快到竟然连我都追不上……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0467216314ca5b99f305f6ad06e77e1a29e85c81b922fab3c757de7bf9d78fbd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "10009"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
